<title>USA: U.S. House Democratic chief unaware of budget deal.</title>
<headline>U.S. House Democratic chief unaware of budget deal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Minority Leader Richard Gephardt said Thursday that the Democrats have not been informed of a budget deal between the White House and Republican leaders of Congress.</p>
<p>He told reporters that he could not guarantee Democratic support for a potential balanced budget agreement until his party was made aware of all the details.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't know what the deal is. I can't say what the views of the (Democratic) caucus will be,&quot; the Missouri Democrat said.</p>
</text>
